        {
          "id": 1985876903,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This is close but still causes warnings if `docbook` has not been built with target `copy_ws.css`.  \n```\nCUSTOMBUILD : warning : C:/builds/wireshark/wireshark/doc/man_pages/androiddump.adoc: \n   stylesheet does not exist or cannot be read: C:/builds/wireshark/wireshark/build/docbook/ws.css \n   [C:\\builds\\wireshark\\wireshark\\build\\doc\\docs.vcxproj]\n```\nAnother `copy_ws.css` like target would be needed in `doc/CMakeLists.txt` since a typical build does not need all the targets in `docbook/CMakeLists.txt`.  \nUsing the existing `copy_ws.css` fails - source paths are different:  \n```\n   100>CUSTOMBUILD : warning : C:/Development/wireshark/doc/release-notes.adoc: \n      stylesheet does not exist or cannot be read: C:/Development/wireshark/doc/ws.css \n      [C:\\Development\\wsbuild64\\doc\\release_notes_html.vcxproj]\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
